license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/yin-yang-membranes"
abstract: >-
  Synthetic toy simulation (classical software, not physical
  holography hardware). Python reference model for the Loop view of
  Holographic Thoughts: two rings of 48 coupled phase oscillators
  tracking conjugate traveling waves. Negative result: at the page's
  coupling (kappa 0.45), coupling lowers joint overlap versus each
  membrane alone and does not speed recovery of a destroyed partner.
keywords: [phase-oscillators, coupled-oscillators, holographic-memory, negative-result, reproducible-research]
